{"key": "learned-bd-update-bdcompound-hm0-6-d-cat-desc-memory-system-d", "type": "learned", "content": "bd update bdcompound-hm0.6 -d \"$(cat <<'DESC\nMemory system demonstration with side-by-side terminals.\n\n## Layout\n- py-32, zinc-950 background\n- Title: \"Compounding memory\" text-5xl zinc-50\n- Side-by-side TerminalMockup components\n- data-reveal on terminal pair (below-fold section)\n\n## Terminal Pair\nprefix, ~8-10 lines of curated output\n- Right terminal: title \"Recall\" -- shows same knowledge recalled three weeks later, ~8-10 lines\n- Terminals side by side on desktop (grid-cols-2 gap-8), stacked on mobile\n- Images for knowledge section: agent-with-memory.jpg committed to site/src/assets/ (use Astro <Image> for optimization)\n\n## Closing Line\n- \"Hit the same problem next month? Your agent already knows the fix.\n- text-xl zinc-400, centered below terminals\n\n## Files\n- Create: site/src/components/Knowledge.astro\n- Add: site/src/assets/agent-with-memory.jpg (compressed <100KB before commit)\n\n## Dependencies\n- Depends on: Infrastructure bead (bdcompound-hm0.1)\n- Depends on: TerminalMockup component (bdcompound-hm0.2)\n\n## Validation\n- Two terminals render side by side on desktop\n- Mobile: terminals stack vertically\n- Terminal content tells the capture->recall story\n- Image renders via Astro <Image> with WebP/AVIF\n- Closing line renders below\nDESC\n)", "source": "user", "tags": ["learned", "layout", "fix", "validation"], "ts": 1773709558, "bead": "bd update bdcompound-hm0.6 -d \"$(cat <<'DESC'"}
