{"key": "learned-6d59d9a7ca46", "type": "learned", "content": "[learned] Created /beads-recall command as lightweight utility (disable-model-invocation: true) that wraps recall.sh script with smart argument parsing. Supports 6 modes: stats, recent N, topic BEAD_ID, bead ID recall (extracts title as keywords), keyword search, and empty (shows usage). Added as new 'Knowledge Access' category in README separate from 'Saving Progress' since it's about retrieval not capture.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["[\"source:lavra\"", "\"go\"", "\"complexity:low\"", "\"pattern:novel\"", "\"learned\"", "\"model\"", "\"entry_type:learned\"]", "auto_tagged", "auto_tagged", "learning"], "ts": 1783128291, "bead": ""}
{"key": "learned-5d53bc630a5b", "type": "learned", "content": "[pattern] New commands should follow beads- prefix if they're part of core workflow, no prefix for utilities. Command categories in README: Planning & Discovery, Executing Work, Reviewing & Quality, Saving Progress, Knowledge Access, Utility. Use disable-model-invocation: true for lightweight lookups that don't need complex reasoning.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["[\"source:lavra\"", "\"pattern\"", "\"go\"", "\"complexity:low\"", "\"pattern:novel\"", "\"entry_type:pattern\"", "\"model\"", "\"fix\"]", "auto_tagged", "auto_tagged", "research"], "ts": 1783128291, "bead": ""}
{"key": "pattern-76363faed9ae", "type": "pattern", "content": "[learned] npx smoke tests need conditional bd install step (same pattern as test-installation job) — bd not in CI by default\nPATTERN: execFileSync with array args prevents shell injection entirely — use instead of execSync with template strings for any user-controlled input\nCommand counts must be consistent across README, CATALOG, plugin.json description, pre-release-check.sh, and CI yaml — update all 5 locations when adding commands", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["[\"tool:file\"", "\"source:lavra\"", "\"pattern\"", "\"job\"", "\"complexity:low\"", "\"learned\"", "\"test\"", "\"entry_type:learned\"]", "auto_tagged", "auto_tagged", "file_ops"], "ts": 1783128291, "bead": ""}
{"key": "learned-cc5d7bdd4549", "type": "learned", "content": "[decision] FACT: Already resolved in Wave 1 via _positional extraction in bdcompound-807.9 fix — single args.find() call\nSet timeout: 30000 (30s) to match plan-view.js pattern but longer since export is a one-shot operation not interactive\nFACT: Already resolved in Wave 1 — replaced contentHeight+20 with Math.max(contentHeight*4, 80) so buffer scales with terminal size\nPinned to bun 1.3.6 (current installed version) and setup-bun@v2; this is a build-only tool so minor version drift risk is low but pinning is good hygiene", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["[\"tool:terminal\"", "\"decision\"", "\"source:lavra\"", "\"pattern\"", "\"go\"", "\"complexity:low\"", "\"ui\"", "\"entry_type:decision\"", "\"timeout\"", "\"fix\"]", "auto_tagged", "auto_tagged", "bugfix"], "ts": 1783128291, "bead": ""}
