{"key": "learned-46ad33abb90a", "type": "learned", "content": "[decision] Applied plan review feedback. 14 recommendations applied across 5 beads (bdcompound-63c.2, .1, .3, .4, .6). Key changes: (1) Phase 3 call order inverted — migrate_beads_to_lavra() before provision_memory_dir() in all installers; (2) Phase 2 scope expanded to fix check-memory.sh line 38 guard and auto-recall.sh lines 32-38 guard (both guard on .beads/ existence, silent failure for non-beads projects); (3) Phase 4 changed to re-run conversion scripts instead of manual sed on platform copies; (4) Security: auto-recall.sh bare heredoc JSON replaced with jq assembly, session-state.md gets sanitization pipeline; (5) Migration function simplified — removed path traversal re-validation, config exclusion logic, and post-copy line count check\" 2>/dev/null", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["decision", "security", "source:lavra", "entry_type:decision", "config", "migration", "complexity:medium", "validation", "fix", "file_ops"], "ts": 1783128299, "bead": ""}
