{"key": "learned-0407061ffc93", "type": "learned", "content": "[decision] auto-recall.sh guard changed from 'if .beads/ missing exit' to 'if both .beads/ AND .lavra/ missing exit'. Non-beads projects with .lavra/ can now use lavra. LAVRA_DIR separate var used for version file path at .lavra/.lavra-version vs MEMORY_DIR for .lavra/memory/. All bare heredoc JSON replaced with jq -cn assembly (H1 fix). session-state.md now sanitized and wrapped in untrusted-knowledge (M1 fix). CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR validation uses realpath canonical check AFTER early-exit guards (H3 fix + perf).", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["[\"decision\"", "\"tool:file\"", "\"source:lavra\"", "\"complexity:low\"", "\"entry_type:decision\"", "\"rust\"", "\"validation\"", "\"fix\"]", "auto_tagged", "auto_tagged", "file_ops"], "ts": 1783128299, "bead": ""}
