{"key": "learned-8534c542850a", "type": "learned", "content": "For AI agents, testing must validate both functional correctness and robust behavior in unpredictable scenarios. This includes unit/integration tests for core logic, regression tests after updates, and targeted evaluations for safety, bias, and error recovery. Automated test suites should simulate diverse user inputs and environmental conditions to ensure reliable, consistent operation.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["complexity:low", "coding"], "ts": 1784798648, "bead": ""}
{"key": "decision-6a1bedf89f2d", "type": "decision", "content": "AI agents must maintain structured, version-controlled documentation for all operational decisions, API interactions, and system changes to enable debugging, auditing, and knowledge transfer. Implement automated decision logs capturing context, rationale, and outcomes for every significant action, paired with living runbooks for common procedures. Integrate documentation generation into the agent's workflow using tools like OpenAPI specs for interfaces and markdown-based runbooks stored alongside code.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["tool:code", "complexity:low", "coding"], "ts": 1784798768, "bead": ""}
{"key": "learned-ccea96556c55", "type": "learned", "content": "Выполнена реализация 6 задач из систематического обзора:\n1. g-001: cross_audit() добавлена в crystal.py (--audit) — проверяет EE↔KC связи\n2. g-002: session_bridge.py — ключевые решения сохраняются между сессиями\n3. g-003: auto_boot_scan.py — проверяет principal, EE sync, heartbeat, stale файлы\n4. g-004: anti-pattern detector — >3 однотипных фикса -> investigation вместо fix\n5. g-005: порог создания скиллов 3->2 (4 изменения в self_improvement_loop.py)\n6. g-006: Principal identity on boot — каждая сессия знает владельца", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["user_communication"], "ts": 1784808149, "bead": ""}
