{"key": "learned-9daa97c6fb98", "type": "learned", "content": "AI agents should automate content validation using predefined rules to ensure quality and consistency. Implement scalable pipelines with modular templates to efficiently generate diverse content types. Monitor key metrics and adjust algorithms based on feedback to optimize output and reduce errors.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["complexity:low", "devops"], "ts": 1785404779, "bead": ""}
{"key": "learned-bc3f03d0e30b", "type": "learned", "content": "An AI content factory operates as a modular pipeline where specialized agents handle discrete stages (research, drafting, editing, formatting) with structured handoffs. Implement quality gates using critic agents and automated metrics (readability, factuality, brand voice) at each stage to prevent error propagation. Scale throughput by parallelizing independent content units and using a supervisor agent for dynamic load balancing and retry logic.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["complexity:low", "devops"], "ts": 1785406270, "bead": ""}
