{"key": "learned-4325af04d921", "type": "learned", "content": "AI agents should maintain structured documentation of their decision-making processes, tool usage, and error handling patterns to enable debugging and knowledge transfer. Use standardized formats like Markdown with frontmatter for machine-readability, and integrate documentation updates into the agent's workflow loops. Prioritize documenting non-obvious logic, external API interactions, and configuration dependencies.", "source": "knowledge-cube", "tags": ["complexity:low", "coding"], "ts": 1785421958, "bead": ""}
